          "script": "\t# implement your method here\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027panInteract\u0027, {\u0027action\u0027:\u0027Interact\u0027},scope\u003d\u0027page\u0027)\n\tparams\u003dsystem.util.jsonDecode(system.util.jsonEncode(self.view.params))\n\tparams[\u0027params\u0027][\u0027config\u0027][\u0027modules\u0027]\u003dself.view.custom.packages[package]\n\tparams[\u0027package\u0027]\u003dTrue\n\tsystem.perspective.sendMessage(\u0027selectFrame\u0027, params ,scope\u003d\u0027session\u0027)"
